Keep a shared digits as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared total as 0.
To fold.
Set total to 0.
For each digit in digits.
Set total to total times 10 plus digit.

The number is 2736.
The rest is number.
Repeat while rest is more than 0.
Place rest modulo 10 into digits.
Set rest to rest divided by 10.

The last is the last position of digits.
The half is last divided by 2.
For every left from 0 to half.
Swap item left of digits and item (last minus left) of digits.

The best is number.
For every first from 0 to last.
For every second from first plus 1 to last.
Swap item first of digits and item second of digits.
Fold.
If total is more than best, set best to total.
Swap item first of digits and item second of digits.

Show best.
